{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_title", "source_sha256": "a3f6c331f02afbc1ad3668a5e531e20b055bb4a96cc268da09e9ec746b79ca0b", "ja": "いっぱいの、いっぱいを。", "zh": "满满的，全部献给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_synopsis", "source_sha256": "3c1f59f57049dadf8d0f647b9605c4baf7be4c50ec4cf8340d208b5a343f4314", "ja": "律子はセンター公演の企画を引き受けたが、\nうまく内容を決めることができない。\n美奈子達は律子をリフレッシュさせるべく、\n街を散策。プロデューサーも駆けつけ、\n律子と、公演への互いの想いを交わした。", "zh": "律子接下了C位公演的企划，\n却迟迟定不下演出的具体内容。\n为了帮律子转换心情，美奈子等人\n拉着她到街上散步。制作人也赶了过去，\n与律子交流了彼此对公演的想法。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1000_null", "source_sha256": "17c93ccce83f40a3d8da920ad432010f2542faf5b8992e37568b0e5838f7d5e4", "ja": "―佐竹飯店―", "zh": "─佐竹饭店─", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "2158ccd61d33747c076a570950a6bcc0d17f192366b057692cb20f8dfb533e2b", "ja": "ふう。ありがと美奈子、落ち着いたわ。\n佐竹飯店って、お茶もおいしいのね。", "zh": "呼。谢谢你，美奈子，我冷静下来了。\n佐竹饭店的茶也很好喝呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "c33d814accf0165809f053020bb0ca9114c41227232f8a9c149aab5fd253e897", "ja": "で？　美奈子はともかく、なんでみんないるわけ？\n仕事は？　レッスンは？", "zh": "那么，美奈子就先不说了，大家为什么都在这儿？\n工作呢？练习呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "ddc8eccfc0e8e896a85c7d9788cdcd333f755e460a69bfa47331664311b404e4", "ja": "真美、ちゃんと兄ちゃんからお休みもらったもん。\n茜ちんとありさちんもね♪", "zh": "真美已经好好地从哥哥那里请到假了。\n茜亲和亚利沙亲也是哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1004_023aka", "source_sha256": "ed3b6f68ce2831733405c670e2d9e626c7f327fb8eb47eabee07784bc6f4e9cd", "ja": "というわけで律子さん、今日はパーッと行こうよ！\n{$P$}ちゃんのおごりだよ♪", "zh": "所以说，律子，今天就痛痛快快玩个尽兴吧！\n是{$P$}请客哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "efd4aa959c81f815b93966c2282c3ad95ebb7bed0c3ee64b8c600141f7ac7605", "ja": "ありさ、{$P$}さんからことづかって\nますから。「領収書よろしく」と！", "zh": "亚利沙可是受了{$P$}先生的托哦。\n“收据就拜托了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "ec4d8b44de7ac24a29fe8fc39e2ac1913a05dc1660886a5f6812d81c3ec5e8f0", "ja": "なに言ってるの。そんな経費、認めませんから。\nもう今月の福利厚生費は余裕ないの！", "zh": "你在说什么啊。那种费用我可不会批准。\n这个月的福利费已经没有余裕了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "63b7f645811bc1d20c18589bd5baaf37f18dce6e94c0ad73bfb8cc303ddfb808", "ja": "ふふ、お代なんていいですから、気軽に注文して\nくださいね♪　肉まんなんてどうですか？", "zh": "呵呵，不用付钱，尽管随意点吧♪ 要不要来个肉包？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1008_009rit", "source_sha256": "f90ee17b8469eddd3e32bbd829c9e0646da2f21a0304b32556f933fc3247d67a", "ja": "もう……。ごめんね、気を使わせちゃって。でも\nせっかくだし……みんなに相談に乗ってもらおうかな？", "zh": "真是的……对不起，让你费心了。不过难得有这个机会……要不还是请大家帮我出出主意吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1009_012mam", "source_sha256": "71d42c8d2874b1d9d50f5fd7411dd4b1b9c0a9eef4c1338fac5addc32e771955", "ja": "え、恋愛相談に？", "zh": "诶，要咨询恋爱问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1010_009rit", "source_sha256": "c320e059de35f141e48c0d0d2551e62667073ef5ff075b96baf9d464d7beb0e4", "ja": "なんで恋愛をつけるの、どっからついたの！　もう。\n……公演の相談に決まってるじゃない。", "zh": "为什么要加上“恋爱”啊，这到底是从哪儿冒出来的！真是的。\n……当然是商量公演的事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "df05913f0a8540a62cf4b39d0fac439a09bfcfa50d815b1149ce8b15b4decac7", "ja": "私ってほら、王道アイドルって路線でもないでしょ？\nそんな私のセンター公演って……どうしようかな、と。", "zh": "你看，我本来就不是那种走正统偶像路线的人吧？\n这样的我要做中心公演……该怎么办才好呢，就是这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1013_023aka", "source_sha256": "58d68e2f6aac6050feb391d454147989ac49039b0987e9f36749c08b5befe3ef", "ja": "はにゃっ？　ということは、律子さん……\nやっぱりセンター公演引き受けるの！？", "zh": "哈喵？也就是说，律子姐……果然要接下C位公演吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "5f4f1890c8e23919acdf59499ff8ca6ff111dd21f37adaaaf1d3a518b68c40c0", "ja": "そんな驚かなくてもいいじゃない。さっきは考えさせて\nって言っただけで……。つまり、もう考えたってこと。", "zh": "不用这么惊讶吧。我刚才只是说让我考虑一下……也就是说，我已经考虑好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1015_009rit", "source_sha256": "c5cbeca8260a818c9ea86ee3818bd8d0df1fd39eb2e92b3160f6418601907b22", "ja": "まあ、考えるまでもないんだけど。だって私、\n最初から、……やる気はあるのよ。", "zh": "不过，本来也不用多想就是了。毕竟我啊，\n从一开始……就很有干劲嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1017_028ari", "source_sha256": "17aa5cc6757b9ad27319134db6f7b23237120ff0625682f18c0193b7e03bdeb6", "ja": "な、なるほど……。よくわかりませんケド、\nよくわかりました。とにかくよかったです！", "zh": "原、原来如此……虽然不是很明白，但我明白了。总之，太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "98b11d76e2165dacace3bca10cecad0cd8092d3688baec47a74bacd8844c5c6a", "ja": "でも、公演をどうするか、ですか？　うーん。\nセンター公演だからこそ、ちょっと難しいのかな？", "zh": "不过，是要考虑公演怎么办吗？嗯——\n正因为是Center公演，才有点难办吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1019_009rit", "source_sha256": "49f555f30e0cc786d9a93c4057ebcadb2b26526e0ad3692083bee9a5fd5262fa", "ja": "そうなの。全体は王道の構成にまとめなきゃって\n思うんだけど、私の立ち位置的に考えると～、なんて。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得整体还是得整理成王道的构成，不过从我的定位来考虑嘛——之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1020_009rit", "source_sha256": "a03137f8f3fdae0c5b508aca622b873dbc99e11991ca84dec8067df2db73e19a", "ja": "ま、朝までキーボード叩いていれば、何か出てくるか。\nよしっ、まずはそこからね！", "zh": "嘛，一直敲键盘敲到早上的话，总能憋出点什么吧。\n好，先从这里着手吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "10bc34c319165fe9c681bf7540340f29a3a3648b7e3c7ba7d5042ce4fd375c2d", "ja": "ええっ、ダメだよ律っちゃん！\nそんなことしてたら、ラフレッシュできないっしょ！？", "zh": "诶，不行啦，律姐！那样下去就没法“焕新鲜”了吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1022_009rit", "source_sha256": "e78ad97ccb07efe4e630d596088be294a661a53e3458c707f80e72436c39de53", "ja": "は？　ラフレ……？", "zh": "啊？放松……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1023_023aka", "source_sha256": "5092ff3dedc06a6f005b646d7a6d75cd9ee8051f4a2c4cee8ecd4207429ca61d", "ja": "ホラ、夜更かしはダメって莉緒やんも言ってたしね！\nアイドルとしてどうなのかと！　どうなのかと！", "zh": "你看，莉绪姐也说过不能熬夜嘛！\n作为偶像，这样真的好吗！真的好吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1024_009rit", "source_sha256": "d1f32adac95add8587fccdaf52305865bf68932ffe407b50c5cfe62d39632f9d", "ja": "ま、まあ、それはそうなんだけど……。", "zh": "嗯、嗯，话是这么说没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "d0b746f9f2fa7b42422486c7d5be0c4d83addf808dbe65f73ef015a2da514e93", "ja": "そうだ！　今からお散歩でも行きませんか？\n今日は天気もいいみたいだし。", "zh": "对了！现在要不要一起去散散步？\n今天的天气似乎也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1026_028ari", "source_sha256": "916fe9a9ee6bebab1ea45aee0c17507840c906095cf747f814f59025f77b8031", "ja": "いいですねお散歩、最高です美奈子ちゃん！\nささ、外に行きましょう律子センパイ！　さささ！", "zh": "散步好呀，太棒了美奈子！\n快快，我们去外面吧律子前辈！快快快！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "50588f60e3440f5584a63ac7dfc6005e755dd34a5a78ead5db4ed3b96c1294de", "ja": "ええっ？　でも、散歩なんて時間が……\nちょっと亜利沙？　みんな！？", "zh": "欸？可是，散步什么的，哪有时间……\n等等，亚利沙？大家！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "66e798e4884e8b22df76c897b848d92eb1ecca2450c318bc4a64dbddbca2e566", "ja": "う～ん！ たしかに気持ちいいわね～。\n解放感もあるし、空気もキレイだし。", "zh": "嗯～！确实让人心情舒畅呢～。\n既有解放感，空气也很清新。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1029_012mam", "source_sha256": "6817047eafe6807802f4336a4c9d59675d073685c4183615baeed23d8adb9a25", "ja": "あー！　律っちゃんほら、ここ、この公園！\n真美がウナギマンしたトコだよね！？", "zh": "啊！律子姐，你看，这里就是这个公园！\n是真美扮鳗鱼侠的地方吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "021afc82c935b69b1bbb67d7ca8072ba4aa9f979d14278df40cf949a01d97bea", "ja": "え？　ああ、そうね、そうそう！\n亜美がカバヤキマンだったわね？", "zh": "咦？啊，对哦，对对！\n是亚美当蒲烧侠的地方吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1031_023aka", "source_sha256": "641c9403b23c14877bcfab18f5af90aae34d17ed6df2acb03931d31a0d61d53c", "ja": "あの……真美ちゃん、律子さん？\nそのエキセントリックな怪人は、なんなのかニャ？", "zh": "那个……真美、律子小姐？\n那个古怪的怪人，到底是什么喵？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "247ac66013ff1a32dfe4cf4482848e9317705087c70827c95b38b5a3c7d18137", "ja": "ふふ。私達がデビューしたばっかりの時ね、ここで\nライブをしたの。でも、誰も立ち止まってくれなくて。", "zh": "呵呵。我们刚出道的时候，曾经在这里办过演唱会。不过，没有一个人愿意停下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1033_012mam", "source_sha256": "173df1149d6a9bc8332372f2fa20c369b5f7b56c9ca3a91896550e92bc58d90f", "ja": "それで真美たちがヒーローショーしたんだ～。\nあ、律っちゃんはオニグンソー刑事ね！", "zh": "于是，真美她们就在这里演了英雄秀～  \n啊，律子姐演的是鬼军曹刑警！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "71b91ab04d60650ca525e7a9409c6526a8d2c5ff28d59ad87b2fda4a9b39d867", "ja": "なるほど。律子センパイは、\n最初からそういう感じだったんですね？", "zh": "原来如此。律子前辈从一开始就是那种感觉啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
