{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1045_028ari", "source_sha256": "67bcd82a75610a582f1381b1a032ae33f85dd1714120e6bc122e6502c37c49e3", "ja": "少女小説がお好きとはいえ、『つま先立ち』シリーズを\n全巻、オトナ買いするほどだったとは……。", "zh": "虽然知道您喜欢少女小说，但没想到您竟然会\n把《踮起脚尖》系列全套一口气买齐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1046_009rit", "source_sha256": "4d459dc08262b810cc066aed99b0ba07fdbfadd12f14ebbcb23a00d1a8f46c19", "ja": "うああ！！　その、乙女とか少女がどうこうは、\n口外禁止ね。……恥ずかしいので。", "zh": "哇啊啊！！　那个、什么少女情怀少女心之类的，\n绝对不准说出去哦。……很丢人的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1047_023aka", "source_sha256": "432a361406b7f98058b65f26ed7f2e4186e5873d6ab8bf37237625249f74a50c", "ja": "はっ！　もしかして茜ちゃん、律子さんの秘密を\n握っちゃった！？　ついに自由が訪れるの！？", "zh": "哈！难道说小茜，我抓住律子姐的秘密了！？终于要获得自由了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1048_009rit", "source_sha256": "1c42cf1cb5a31958bbb202dff3d72da2b0661f09e20d0c6f26d518dce76be3b4", "ja": "人聞きの悪いこと言わないでっ。それじゃ私が普段、\n茜を押さえつけてるみたいじゃない。", "zh": "别说这种容易让人误会的话！搞得好像我平时一直在压制茜似的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_066_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_066_1049_023aka", "source_sha256": "1398d724e450963ab2a472a5c9cf0ee181e675d63f00fe18ebf131fa9c5d67c5", "ja": "な、なるほど……。くっ、茜ちゃんは今、\n状況認識のすれ違いを激しく感じてます……！", "zh": "原、原来如此……。呜，小茜现在强烈感受到我们对状况的认知完全错位了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
